### 7. Milestones & Phasing

* **Phase 1: Core Engine & TUI MVP (Weeks 1–3)**
  * `notify` + `git2`/`gix` reactive diff watcher.
  * Ratatui diff renderer with unified view and hunk folding.
  * Changed files drawer (`Tab`) and fuzzy file picker (`f` / `Ctrl-p`).
  * `tmux send-keys` context injection on `Enter`.
* **Phase 2: Review Intelligence & Steering (Weeks 4–6)**
  * Inline comment dialog and `.lgtm/comments.jsonl` context anchoring.
  * Batch prompt builder (`Ctrl-s`).
  * Weakened-test & fraudulent test validity heuristics (`T` mutation probe).
  * Side-by-side diff mode (`d`).
* **Phase 3: Polish & Ecosystem (Weeks 7–8)**
  * Zellij and OSC 52 clipboard fallback adapters.
  * `$EDITOR` hand-off (`e`/`o`) and stage/discard controls (`s`/`X`).
  * Headless CI mode (`lgtm ci`) and GitHub PR review bot (inline diff comments + sticky summary).
  * Composite GitHub Action (`lgtm-cli/action@v1`) and CLI gating (`--fail-on=...`).
